## Key Concepts

- Cross-region replication topology and latency considerations
- Disaster recovery metrics (RPO/RTO) and measurement
- Automated failover with leader election and consensus protocols
- Cache consistency and warm-up strategies across regions
- End-to-end validation under load with chaos engineering

## Code Example

